cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use FunPan, please cite the preprint listed under preferred-citation, together with the tools listed in the README."
title: "FunPan: Filamentous Fungi Pangenome Analysis Pipeline"
abstract: >-
  FunPan downloads, quality-filters, annotates and analyses filamentous fungi
  pangenomes, with a focus on secondary metabolite biosynthesis and comparative
  genomics. This software accompanies the manuscript "Four-species Aspergillus
  pan-GWAS reveals rare genome expansion in pathogenicity and contraction in
  domestication".
type: software
